  "releaseNotes": "0.4.3: Auto-generation of keys is supported only for GUIDs, as in the provider proposed to the AI Community Toolkit: a string key with IsAutoGenerated throws a NotSupportedException when the collection is built. The NuGet description says that the provider has the same code as CommunityToolkit.VectorData.Chroma, and moves to it when that package ships. All the releases: https://github.com/ChromaDotNet/ChromaDB.VectorData/releases",
